# Windows E2E image (test/docker-win/Dockerfile) needs only the deploy automation, the test
# entrypoint and the standalone misc\ diagnostics. Exclude everything else so the build context
# stays tiny (the repo root otherwise sends multi-GB of published output / VM artifacts / .git
# to the daemon).
*
!deploy
!test
!misc
# ...but never the run logs misc\Set-CxServiceLabels.ps1 leaves next to itself.
misc/*.log
